# OpenSimulator modules, packaged as opensim-<core>-<module>, where <core> is a
# release (the last one of packaging/opensim-core.versions, or MODULES_CORE) or
# unstable, each in /usr/share/opensim-modules/<core>/<module>, not loaded
# until enabled.
# One line per file: module, core, module version (0.0~git<date>.<commit> for
# a snapshot of an unversioned source, <version>+git<date>.<commit> after the
# version the source declares), packaging revision (the next one for any change
# to a published package), file: a path in this repository, or a URL followed
# by its SHA256 and the name to install.

# A DLL only works with the OpenSimulator it was built for, unstable is the commit of upstream/opensim
